{"name": "s2", "dur": 46.77, "lines": [{"id": "q01", "t0": 0.35, "t1": 1.56, "clip": 0.29, "text": "少数一个 1，", "ch": [0.35, 0.523, 0.696, 0.869, 1.041, 1.214, 1.387], "sub": null, "big": "少数一个 1，", "seg": "open", "src": ""}, {"id": "q02", "t0": 1.96, "t1": 2.98, "clip": 1.9, "text": "这句话就全乱了。", "ch": [1.96, 2.087, 2.215, 2.342, 2.47, 2.598, 2.725, 2.853], "sub": null, "big": "这句话就全乱了。", "seg": "open", "src": ""}, {"id": "q03", "t0": 3.38, "t1": 10.58, "clip": 3.32, "text": "芯片之间每秒要数上千亿个 0 和 1。可线上连着五个 1，看起来就是一条直线：四个，还是五个？", "ch": [3.38, 3.521, 3.662, 3.803, 3.944, 4.085, 4.226, 4.367, 4.508, 4.649, 4.79, 4.931, 5.072, 5.213, 5.354, 5.495, 5.636, 5.777, 5.918, 6.059, 6.21, 6.36, 6.511, 6.662, 6.813, 6.963, 7.114, 7.265, 7.415, 7.566, 7.733, 7.901, 8.068, 8.236, 8.403, 8.571, 8.738, 8.906, 9.073, 9.24, 9.408, 9.575, 9.743, 9.91, 10.078, 10.245, 10.413], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "open", "src": ""}, {"id": "q04", "t0": 10.83, "t1": 12.94, "clip": 10.77, "text": "没人在旁边打拍子，它怎么数清？", "ch": [10.83, 10.96, 11.09, 11.22, 11.35, 11.48, 11.61, 11.74, 11.87, 12.11, 12.248, 12.387, 12.525, 12.663, 12.802], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "open", "src": ""}, {"id": "q05", "t0": 13.39, "t1": 17.31, "clip": 13.33, "text": "就像你跟着一首歌拍手：没人给你打拍子，你听着鼓点，自然就跟上了。", "ch": [13.39, 13.512, 13.635, 13.757, 13.88, 14.002, 14.125, 14.247, 14.37, 14.492, 14.615, 14.737, 14.86, 14.982, 15.105, 15.227, 15.35, 15.472, 15.595, 15.717, 15.84, 15.962, 16.085, 16.207, 16.33, 16.453, 16.575, 16.698, 16.82, 16.942, 17.065, 17.188], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "explain", "src": ""}, {"id": "q06", "t0": 17.76, "t1": 23.13, "clip": 17.69, "text": "芯片也一样：信号每跳一下，就是一个鼓点。它跟着鼓点校准自己，几下就踩准了。", "ch": [17.76, 17.887, 18.013, 18.14, 18.267, 18.393, 18.65, 18.821, 18.993, 19.164, 19.336, 19.507, 19.679, 19.95, 20.043, 20.136, 20.229, 20.321, 20.414, 20.507, 20.75, 20.885, 21.02, 21.155, 21.29, 21.425, 21.56, 21.695, 21.83, 21.965, 22.26, 22.384, 22.509, 22.633, 22.757, 22.881, 23.006], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "reveal", "src": ""}, {"id": "q07", "t0": 24.18, "t1": 27.35, "clip": 24.1, "text": "踩准以后，每一拍看一眼：五个，不是四个。", "ch": [24.18, 24.338, 24.497, 24.655, 24.814, 24.973, 25.131, 25.29, 25.448, 25.607, 25.765, 25.924, 26.082, 26.241, 26.399, 26.558, 26.716, 26.875, 27.033, 27.192], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "reveal", "src": ""}, {"id": "q08", "t0": 27.8, "t1": 32.55, "clip": 27.75, "text": "可要是一长串全是 1，就像歌里拖了一个长音，没有鼓点，拍子就会慢慢跑偏。", "ch": [27.8, 27.923, 28.047, 28.17, 28.294, 28.417, 28.54, 28.664, 28.787, 28.91, 29.034, 29.157, 29.293, 29.429, 29.564, 29.7, 29.836, 29.971, 30.107, 30.243, 30.379, 30.514, 30.65, 30.786, 30.921, 31.057, 31.193, 31.329, 31.464, 31.6, 31.736, 31.871, 32.007, 32.143, 32.279, 32.414], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "reveal", "src": ""}, {"id": "q09", "t0": 32.8, "t1": 37.5, "clip": 32.74, "text": "所以发出去之前，先把数据打乱，让鼓点一直都在；收到以后，再还原回来。", "ch": [32.8, 32.938, 33.076, 33.215, 33.353, 33.491, 33.629, 33.768, 33.906, 34.044, 34.182, 34.321, 34.459, 34.597, 34.735, 34.874, 35.012, 35.15, 35.288, 35.426, 35.565, 35.703, 35.841, 35.979, 36.118, 36.256, 36.394, 36.532, 36.671, 36.809, 36.947, 37.085, 37.224, 37.362], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "reveal", "src": ""}, {"id": "q10", "t0": 37.95, "t1": 38.7, "clip": 37.89, "text": "一句话带走：", "ch": [37.95, 38.075, 38.2, 38.325, 38.45, 38.575], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "end", "src": ""}, {"id": "q11", "t0": 38.95, "t1": 41.75, "clip": 38.89, "text": "芯片数 0 和 1，靠的不是眼睛，是耳朵。", "ch": [38.95, 39.059, 39.168, 39.277, 39.386, 39.494, 39.603, 39.712, 39.821, 39.93, 40.039, 40.194, 40.35, 40.506, 40.661, 40.817, 40.972, 41.128, 41.283, 41.439, 41.594], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "end", "src": ""}, {"id": "q12", "t0": 42.0, "t1": 45.17, "clip": 41.94, "text": "下一条：芯片说速度翻倍，该问哪三句？", "ch": [42.0, 42.135, 42.27, 42.405, 42.69, 42.862, 43.035, 43.207, 43.38, 43.552, 43.725, 43.898, 44.33, 44.47, 44.61, 44.75, 44.89, 45.03], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "end", "src": ""}], "shots": [{"kind": "chat", "t0": 0, "paper": false, "first": "q01", "t1": 13.09}, {"kind": "clap", "t0": 13.09, "paper": false, "first": "q05", "t1": 17.46}, {"kind": "beat", "t0": 17.46, "paper": false, "first": "q06", "t1": 27.5}, {"kind": "scramble", "t0": 27.5, "paper": false, "first": "q08", "t1": 37.65}, {"kind": "take", "t0": 37.65, "paper": true, "first": "q10", "type": [{"text": "一句话带走", "line": "q10", "from": null, "to": null}, {"text": "靠的不是眼睛，", "line": "q11", "from": "靠的", "to": "眼睛"}, {"text": "是耳朵。", "line": "q11", "from": "是耳朵", "to": "耳朵"}], "cy": 700, "t1": 46.77}], "hudIn": 13.09}